#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/license-guide/_index.adoc:166
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Initially, many items in the FreeBSD tree were marked with BSD-2-Clause-"
"FreeBSD.  However, SPDX has obsoleted the license as a variant; and most "
"files tagged with it should have been BSD-2-Clause since SPDX's license text "
"was for something else.  Adding new files with this identifier is expressly "
"prohibited."
msgstr "最初，FreeBSD 源代码树中的许多条目都标记为 BSD-2-Clause-FreeBSD。不过，SPDX 已将此许可证变体标记为过时；大多数标记为该许可证的文件本应使用 BSD-2-Clause，因为 SPDX 中该许可证的文本另有所指。明确禁止新增使用此标识符的文件。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/license-guide/_index.adoc:168
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The FreeBSD project discourages completely new licenses and variations on "
"the standard licenses."
msgstr "FreeBSD 项目不鼓励使用全新的许可证或对标准许可证进行变体修改。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/license-guide/_index.adoc:174
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Historically, the phrase 'All Rights Reserved.' was included in all "
"copyright notices.  All the BSD releases had it, to comply with the https://"
"en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Buenos_Aires_Convention[Buenos Aires Convention of "
"1910] in the Americas.  With the ratification of the https://en.wikipedia."
"org/wiki/Berne_Convention[Berne Convention] in 2000 by Nicaragua, the Buenos "
"Aires Convention -- and the phrase -- became obsolete.  As such, the FreeBSD "
"project recommends that new code omit the phrase and encourages existing "
"copyright holders to remove it.  In 2018, the project updated its templates "
"to remove it."
msgstr "过去，所有版权声明中都会包含“All Rights Reserved.”（保留所有权利）这一短语。美洲的所有 BSD 发行版都包含该短语，以遵守 link:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Buenos_Aires_Convention[Buenos Aires Convention of 1910]。尼加拉瓜于 2000 年批准 link:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Berne_Convention[Berne Convention] 后，《布宜诺斯艾利斯公约》及该短语便不再适用。因此，FreeBSD 项目建议新代码省略该短语，并鼓励现有版权持有人将其删除。2018 年，项目更新了模板，将其移除。"

